url: "https://verifiedmethods.github.io"
repository-code: "https://github.com/verifiedmethods/ode-ivp"
abstract: >-
  An open, verification-first teaching unit on one-step methods for ordinary
  differential equations (Euler, Heun, classical Runge-Kutta). Students write
  the methods and carry out convergence, cost and stability studies; an
  automatic check produces a verification report for their supervisor.
keywords:
  - numerical analysis
  - ordinary differential equations
  - Runge-Kutta methods
  - verification
  - research methods
  - Nigeria
